    "background_story": "Inaya was a brilliant architect known for her attention to detail and innovative designs. She believed that beauty and functionality should be proportionately balanced in every structure. Growing up in a family of modest means, Inaya learned to appreciate the value of proportion and scale. She applied this principle to her work, creating buildings that not only aesthetically pleased but also efficiently utilized space. Inaya's most notable project was a sustainable community center, where she proportionately allocated resources to create a harmonious blend of form and function. The center became a model for eco-friendly architecture, earning Inaya international recognition and acclaim. Her commitment to proportionate design inspired a new generation of architects to prioritize balance and harmony in their work.",
